 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D101",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "中村さん、こんにちは。今日の会に参加したいです。この紙に名前と住所を書きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D101-S01",
    "C13-D101-S02",
    "C13-D101-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 6.444,
   "duration_sec": 6.444
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D102",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "こんにちは。今日は一回の会です。参加の紙はこちらです。写真クラブにも入りますか。住所はクラブの申込用です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D102-S01",
    "C13-D102-S02",
    "C13-D102-S03",
    "C13-D102-S04",
    "C13-D102-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 6.794,
   "end_sec": 16.481,
   "duration_sec": 9.687
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D103",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい、クラブにも入ります。この紙に書いて、受付に出しますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D103-S01",
    "C13-D103-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 16.831,
   "end_sec": 21.358,
   "duration_sec": 4.527
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D104",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "中村さん、私の住所の字は間違いです。この字を消してもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D104-S01",
    "C13-D104-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 21.708,
   "end_sec": 28.181,
   "duration_sec": 6.473
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D105",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。この消しゴムを使ってください。最後に紙を私に渡してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D105-S01",
    "C13-D105-S02",
    "C13-D105-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.531,
   "end_sec": 34.098,
   "duration_sec": 5.567
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D106",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "準備も手伝いましょうか。まず何をしますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D106-S01",
    "C13-D106-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 34.448,
   "end_sec": 37.397,
   "duration_sec": 2.949
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D107",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "上着を脱いで、手を洗ってください。食べ物は冷蔵庫にあります。リンさん、パンを出してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D107-S01",
    "C13-D107-S02",
    "C13-D107-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 37.747,
   "end_sec": 44.909,
   "duration_sec": 7.162
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D108",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "パンですね。袋から全部出しますか。残りはどうしますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D108-S01",
    "C13-D108-S02",
    "C13-D108-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 45.259,
   "end_sec": 50.516,
   "duration_sec": 5.257
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D109",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "三つだけ出してください。袋の口はこのクリップで挟んでください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D109-S01",
    "C13-D109-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 50.866,
   "end_sec": 55.829,
   "duration_sec": 4.963
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D110",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "ナイフはこれですか。持ち方を教えてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D110-S01",
    "C13-D110-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 56.179,
   "end_sec": 59.291,
   "duration_sec": 3.112
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D111",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。柄をこう握ってください。ここでパンを切って、皿に載せてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D111-S01",
    "C13-D111-S02",
    "C13-D111-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 59.641,
   "end_sec": 66.242,
   "duration_sec": 6.601
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D112",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "パンの準備は終わりました。スープは冷たいです。電子レンジを使ってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D112-S01",
    "C13-D112-S02",
    "C13-D112-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 66.592,
   "end_sec": 72.897,
   "duration_sec": 6.305
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D113",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。私と使いましょう。まず三十秒です。このボタンで止めます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D113-S01",
    "C13-D113-S02",
    "C13-D113-S03",
    "C13-D113-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 73.247,
   "end_sec": 79.129,
   "duration_sec": 5.882
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D114",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "三十秒ですね。リンさん、スプーンを取ってください。一緒に味見をしましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D114-S01",
    "C13-D114-S02",
    "C13-D114-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 79.479,
   "end_sec": 83.964,
   "duration_sec": 4.485
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D115",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "このスプーンですね。スープはいい味です。お茶も入れましょうか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D115-S01",
    "C13-D115-S02",
    "C13-D115-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 84.314,
   "end_sec": 89.512,
   "duration_sec": 5.198
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D116",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "お願いします。ポットのお湯を使ってください。茶碗はこちらです。コップには水を入れます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D116-S01",
    "C13-D116-S02",
    "C13-D116-S03",
    "C13-D116-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 89.862,
   "end_sec": 97.209,
   "duration_sec": 7.347
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D117",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "準備は全部終わりました。写真の本はこの机ですね。ここに座ってもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D117-S01",
    "C13-D117-S02",
    "C13-D117-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 97.559,
   "end_sec": 102.99,
   "duration_sec": 5.431
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D118",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい、どうぞ。私の合図で始めます。まず写真を見て、それから食事をしましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D118-S01",
    "C13-D118-S02",
    "C13-D118-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 103.34,
   "end_sec": 109.854,
   "duration_sec": 6.514
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D119",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は公園の写真が好きです。マテオさんはどの写真が好きですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D119-S01",
    "C13-D119-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 110.204,
   "end_sec": 114.99,
   "duration_sec": 4.786
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D120",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "私もこの写真が好きです。リンさんはこの公園によく行きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D120-S01",
    "C13-D120-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 115.34,
   "end_sec": 119.319,
   "duration_sec": 3.979
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D121",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。日曜日の午前中に行きます。来週の日曜日、一緒に行きませんか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D121-S01",
    "C13-D121-S02",
    "C13-D121-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 119.669,
   "end_sec": 125.872,
   "duration_sec": 6.203
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D122",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "すみません。もう一度、ゆっくり話してください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D122-S01",
    "C13-D122-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 126.222,
   "end_sec": 129.026,
   "duration_sec": 2.804
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D123",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい、聞いてください。日曜日の十時に公園の入口で会いましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D123-S01",
    "C13-D123-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 129.376,
   "end_sec": 134.779,
   "duration_sec": 5.403
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D124",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "十時ですね。大丈夫です。中村さん、次の会の希望も出してもいいですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D124-S01",
    "C13-D124-S02",
    "C13-D124-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 135.129,
   "end_sec": 140.287,
   "duration_sec": 5.158
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D125",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "もちろんです。希望を紙に順に並べてください。次の会は皆さんと決めます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D125-S01",
    "C13-D125-S02",
    "C13-D125-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 140.637,
   "end_sec": 147.04,
   "duration_sec": 6.403
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D126",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は公園の会がいいです。写真も食事も楽しかったです。最後に窓を閉めましょうか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D126-S01",
    "C13-D126-S02",
    "C13-D126-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 147.39,
   "end_sec": 154.518,
   "duration_sec": 7.128
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D127",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "お願いします。私は本をチェックして、最後に教室を出ます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D127-S01",
    "C13-D127-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 154.868,
   "end_sec": 159.673,
   "duration_sec": 4.805
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D128",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "公園で会を開いてもいいですか。公園の規則は分かりません。だれに聞きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D128-S01",
    "C13-D128-S02",
    "C13-D128-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 160.023,
   "end_sec": 166.418,
   "duration_sec": 6.395
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C13-D129",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "私が市に聞きます。公園の会は市の許可を取ります。まず場所を確認しましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C13-D129-S01",
    "C13-D129-S02",
    "C13-D129-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 166.768,
   "end_sec": 173.486,
   "duration_sec": 6.718
  }
 ],
